  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0091","idiomatic","Anyone who forces entry into the palace shouting to reach the emperor's ear shall receive 107 strokes and be deported to the Yuan homeland.","Anyone who forces entry into the palace shouting to reach the emperor's ear shall receive 107 strokes and be sent back to their original household register.","s0091 ends 發元籍: 元籍 is the original household register, not a Yuan homeland; the proposed idiomatic correctly replaces the invented deportation.","high","applied"],
    ["s0091","literal","As to persons wishing to present a matter who force their way into the palace halls, shouting in hope that the sovereign will hear—one hundred seven blows of the cudgel, and deportation to the Yuan homeland register.","As to persons wishing to present a matter who force their way into the palace halls, shouting in hope that the sovereign will hear—one hundred seven blows of the cudgel, and return to the original household register.","s0091 發元籍 uses 元 as original (household registration), not the dynastic name; the literal correctly drops the Yuan-homeland misreading.","high","applied"],
    ["s0204","idiomatic","Court-attending officials who gather in partisan factions without cause are punished and their appointment is deferred.","Court-attending officials who without cause fail to assemble for public business are punished and their appointment is deferred.","s0204 無故不公聚 is without-cause failure to assemble for public business; 不 negates 公聚, so partisan-faction gathering invents the opposite sense.","high","applied"],
    ["s0204","literal","As to court-attending officials who without cause gather for partisan purposes, guilt attaches and appointment by selection is delayed.","As to court-attending officials who without cause fail to assemble publicly, guilt attaches and appointment by selection is delayed.","s0204 不公聚 is failure to assemble publicly/for official business, not gathering for partisan purposes; the proposed literal restores the negation.","high","applied"],
    ["s0280","literal","As to Miao and Liao bandits raiding at the borders of Hunan, Hubei, Jiangxi, and the two Guang regions—supervising officials who do not strictly prohibit and punish, or who deliberately condone—military officers thirty-seven blows of flogging, civilian officials twenty-seven blows, and all have one received rank grade reduced, with a demerit recorded.","As to creek-and-cave tribal bandits raiding at the borders of Hunan, Hubei, Jiangxi, and the two Guang regions—supervising officials who do not strictly prohibit and punish, or who deliberately condone—military officers thirty-seven blows of flogging, civilian officials twenty-seven blows, and all have one received rank grade reduced, with a demerit recorded.","s0280 溪洞蠻獠 is creek-and-cave southern tribal peoples; 蠻獠 is a general label and does not name Miao or Liao as ethnonyms.","high","applied"]
  ],
